# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.local — Portfolio RAG Chatbot Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in ONE key (priority order below).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTION A — Groq (FREE, recommended — no credit card needed)
# Fast Llama 3.1 8B inference. 14,400 free requests/day.
# Sign up at: https://console.groq.com → API Keys → Create
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# OPTION B — OpenAI (paid, ~$0.001 per chat message with gpt-4o-mini)
# Get yours at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# OPTION C — HuggingFace (free tier, but slow)
# Get yours at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_...

# NOTE: Priority is GROQ → OPENAI → HUGGINGFACE.
# If none are set, the chatbot still works using a keyword-based fallback
# (returns the best matching context snippet without LLM generation).
